---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MCP" locale="en" currentPath="/docs/mcp">
  <PageHeader title="MCP (Model Context Protocol)" subtitle="Full MCP server with 160+ tools for AI agents" />

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4">Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-6">
        Agents should not have to guess the CLI -- keyflip speaks MCP. The full CLI surface is exposed as 160+ MCP tools, so an agent can do everything without shelling out.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Setup</h2>
      <CodeBlock code={`claude mcp add keyflip -- keyflip mcp
# or see the full setup:
keyflip mcp --setup`} />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Tool Categories</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Accounts</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_status</code>, <code>keyflip_list</code>, <code>keyflip_switch</code>, <code>keyflip_next</code>, <code>keyflip_add</code>, <code>keyflip_account_remove</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Providers</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_providers</code>, <code>keyflip_provider_catalog</code> (presets), <code>keyflip_provider_models</code> (GET /v1/models), <code>keyflip_provider_use</code>, <code>keyflip_provider_add</code> (optionally with <code>catalog_id</code>), <code>keyflip_provider_remove</code>, <code>keyflip_test_provider</code>, <code>keyflip_speedtest</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Fleet</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_fleet_status</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_push</code> (publish status + process the inbox, secrets/apply consent kept separate), <code>keyflip_fleet_discover</code> (find peers on the LAN), <code>keyflip_fleet_switch</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_send_account</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_collect</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_keys</code>, <code>keyflip_fleet_trust</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Sessions</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_sessions</code>, <code>keyflip_sessions_assign</code>, <code>keyflip_sessions_attribute</code> (infer unassigned accounts from the switch log), <code>keyflip_resume_command</code>, archive, distill, compact</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Threads, chains &amp; preflight</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_threads</code> (read: list, timeline, suggest, reverse id), <code>keyflip_thread_create|add|remove|drop|mirror</code>, <code>keyflip_chains</code> / <code>keyflip_chains_tighten</code>, <code>keyflip_switch_plan</code>, <code>keyflip_verify</code>, <code>keyflip_refresh</code> / <code>keyflip_refresh_schedule</code>, <code>keyflip_llm</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">History hygiene</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_history_audit</code> (splits <code>alarm_count</code> from <code>tolerated_count</code>), <code>keyflip_memory_audit</code>, <code>keyflip_history_scrub</code> (plan by default, bundle before any rewrite), <code>keyflip_secrets_policy</code> (read-only) / <code>keyflip_secrets_tolerate</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Conversations</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_conv_list</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_search</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_context</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_show</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_status</code> (read-only, never build the index themselves), <code>keyflip_conv_index</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_export</code> / <code>keyflip_conv_index_schedule</code> (confirm-gated). List, search and show carry the <strong>account</strong> that worked on each chat with its label (<code>accountSource</code>: <code>stated</code> = you assigned it, <code>inferred</code> = keyflip's switch timeline) and <code>accountConfidence</code>, and <code>account</code> filters by it</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Context Layer</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1"><code>keyflip_context_read</code>, <code>keyflip_context_task_set</code>, <code>keyflip_context_decision_add</code>, <code>keyflip_checkpoint_*</code>, <code>keyflip_handoff</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-800 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">More</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mt-1">Migrate/LAN, WebDAV sync, <code>keyflip://</code> links, desktop gateway, MCP-server registry, directory pins, diagnostics, backups, skills, failover proxy (<code>keyflip_proxy_status</code> / <code>keyflip_proxy_control</code>, <code>keyflip_proxy_routes</code> / <code>keyflip_proxy_explain</code> / <code>keyflip_cooldowns</code> read-only, <code>keyflip_cooldown_clear</code> confirm-gated; plans and cost: <code>keyflip_tiers</code> / <code>keyflip_cost_rates</code> / <code>keyflip_cost_status</code> / <code>keyflip_cost_by_project</code> read-only, <code>keyflip_tier_set</code> confirm-gated)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Safety Model</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li>Every tool has a proper JSON Schema and read-only/destructive annotations</li>
        <li><strong>Mutating tools require <code>confirm: true</code></strong> -- descriptions tell agents to ask the user first</li>
        <li>Secrets are never accepted through MCP (e.g., adding a provider key is deferred to <code>--key-file</code> on CLI)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-4 mt-10">Agent Skill, Every Agent</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-700 dark:text-surface-300 mb-4">A bundled skill teaches the agent when and how to use keyflip (rate-limit playbook, sentinels, parallel sessions). It is installed for Claude and fanned out to every other detected agent (Cursor, Kiro, Codex, Qoder, …):</p>
      <CodeBlock code={`keyflip install-skill             # Claude + every detected agent\nkeyflip skill agents              # the 72 target dirs, ● = present here\nkeyflip skill add owner/repo      # any skill → every detected agent`} />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
